// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2_SG_AP_Mission_1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1575892381" "We've learned that a Villain from the Rogue Isles has come to Paragon City, intent on causing destruction in Atlas Park, in order to rob the bank there. And this villain has enlisted an army of Vahzilok to do it. We need heroes to<A HREF={ACCEPT}>go to Atlas Park and protect the bank from that villains!</A> The robbers are already at the bank, you should make your way there immediately. You probably have about 5 minutes or less before they make their escape.<br><br><color orange>This is a Safeguard mission. Once you prevent the heist, you will have 15 minutes to explore the area and potentially earn extra rewards before the P.P.D. lock down the area. You can earn extra time by defeating vandals and completing side missions, however you can lose time if they destroy too much of the city.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2964068792" "Protect Atlas Park bank"
// SendOffString :
"P1417514329" "Word of the coming heist has spread through the underworld, and there are rumors that the Hellions will be on the street trying to take advantage of the situation. While the bank and the villain are your main objective, stopping any random crimes could save a lot of people.<br><br><color orange>Periodically, vandals will arrive to destroy parts of the city. You will see a message when they arrive, and their locations will be displayed in your minimap.</color>"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2541866575" "Go protect Atlas Park!"
// DeclineString :
"P737905035" "Sorry, can't help you this time."
// DeclineSendOffString :
"P3311727586" "What?! I understand, {HeroName}. You no doubt have some very important things to do. We'll do our best to stop them, but it doesn't look good."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1905473816" "You've arrived in Atlas Park just in time! It looks like Hellions are trying to take advantage of the situation to terrorize the city. You'll have to watch out for them as well as the Vahzilok, as you try to restore order, protect the city, and stop that bank robbery!"

